# Build artifacts
build/
*.o
*.elf
*.bin
!rom/prebuilt/*.bin
!refemu/tests/fixtures/riscv_tests/*.bin
!native/tests/fixtures/*.bin
# Traces & benchmark output (regenerate via `just`; do not commit)
traces/
*.trace
bench-results/
# demo3 reference harness working state (issue #129) -- large, binary or
# derived, per-run, and never the deliverable itself. The trace .tsv is
# deliberately NOT committed (team lead's call: ~20-30 MB of data that
# changes with every ROM, cheaply regenerable in ~50 minutes) -- only its
# small companion .json manifest (final icount/fb_hash/exit_code/
# PINNED_HASH/trace sha256) is meant to be committed, reviewed and added
# deliberately, not swept in by a broad `git add`.
refemu/reference_traces/demo3/*.tsv
refemu/reference_traces/demo3/*.state.pkl
refemu/reference_traces/demo3/*.state.pkl.tmp
refemu/reference_traces/demo3/*.progress.json
refemu/reference_traces/demo3/*.progress.json.tmp
# Rust
target/
# libFuzzer's own exploration and its crash dumps. A case worth keeping is
# copied into fuzz/corpus/ by hand, named for what it exercises.
fuzz/artifacts/
fuzz/corpus/*/
!fuzz/corpus/*/.gitkeep

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Local git worktrees.
worktrees/

# Local agent configuration and notes. Nothing here is part of the project.
/.claude/

# Local working notes, deliberately not part of the project.
/HANDOVER.md
/docs/phase-3.md
